              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Halberdiers have hand weapon and halberd and may have light armour (+2). Halberdiers and spearmen may use Combined Formation: up to 50% of each unit may be comprised of Missile Troops (below).</characteristic>
